265
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,100
Chengde, Shanxi.

266
00:09:19,139 --> 00:09:20,340
Itu di Hebei!

267
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:21,899
Saya berasal dari Shanxi dan Hebei.

268
00:09:22,379 --> 00:09:24,059
Tidak, saya berada di Hebei Shanxi.

269
00:09:24,639 --> 00:09:25,539
SAYA...

270
00:09:25,539 --> 00:09:27,899
Saya berada di... Chengde, Hebei.

271
00:09:28,379 --> 00:09:30,259
Seiring bertambahnya usia, otak tidak berfungsi sebaik dulu.

272
00:09:31,700 --> 00:09:32,820
Editor Zhao, Anda membutuhkan saya untuk apa?

273
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:34,379
Oh.

274
00:09:35,019 --> 00:09:37,299
"Interpretasi Baru Saya tentang Metrik Puisi Klasik"?

275
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:38,220
