276
00:09:38,620 --> 00:09:39,259
Terima kasih.

277
00:09:39,259 --> 00:09:40,179
Terima kasih banyak.

278
00:09:40,940 --> 00:09:42,299
Kalau begitu, cepat kirimkan ke saya.

279
00:09:42,580 --> 00:09:43,740
Saya punya waktu.

280
00:09:43,740 --> 00:09:45,659
Anda berada di Chengde, bagaimana Anda punya waktu?

281
00:09:46,539 --> 00:09:48,019
Oke, saya berada di Chengde.

282
00:09:48,019 --> 00:09:48,460
Benar?

283
00:09:50,940 --> 00:09:51,840
Baiklah kalau begitu.

284
00:09:52,059 --> 00:09:52,659
Oke.

285
00:09:52,659 --> 00:09:53,860
Kita akan bicara nanti.

286
00:09:54,379 --> 00:09:55,179
Selamat tinggal.

287
00:09:55,940 --> 00:09:57,580
Bodoh sekali, benar-benar bodoh.

288
00:09:57,620 --> 00:09:58,500
Ini semua salahmu.

289
00:09:58,580 --> 00:09:59,860
Anda bersikeras agar saya mengatakan bahwa saya sedang berada di luar kota.

290
00:10:00,059 --> 00:10:01,139
